(1, '19fbbba6a7c26eab', 'thread_6a6d7fa1a97bb_1785560993', 2, 'hardenfaderon@gmail.com', 'hardenfaderon@gmail.com', '[\"edrianfaderon@gmail.com\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Re: Partnership Opportunity with Armful Media', 'Hi there,\r\nI hope you\'re doing well. I wanted to follow up on my previous email about a potential collaboration between you and Armful Media.\r\nI understand you receive many partnership requests, but I truly believe our brand aligns well with your content and audience. We\'d love to offer you exclusive products from our new line.\r\nWould you have 10 minutes this week for a quick call to discuss this further?\r\nLooking forward to your response!\r\nBest,\r\nEdrianooo', 'Hi there,\r\nI hope you\'re doing well. I wanted to follow up on my previous email about a potential collaboration between you and Armful Media.\r\nI understand you receive many partnership requests, but I truly believe our brand aligns well with your content and audience. We\'d love to offer you exclusive products from our new line.\r\nWould you have 10 minutes this week for a quick call to discuss this further?\r\nLooking forward to your response!\r\nBest,\r\nEdrianooo', 0, NULL, 'outgoing', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, '2026-07-31 23:09:54', NULL, '2026-08-01 05:09:54', '2026-08-01 05:09:54'),
